      "content": "thanks for that. it's a good start and pretty clear. \n\nactually, looking at it now, the completeness score for our last report came back a bit low because the list wasn't long enough. the boss is really pushing for \"comprehensive\" coverage this time. \n\ncan you expand on this? try to be as exhaustive as possible with the different features, specs, and technical details for both the SonicBuds and the AudioFlow so we don't get flagged for being too brief again. i still want it to be helpful, but definitely lean into more detail so we get a higher score on the feature count. maybe include things like materials, sensor types, or extra settings?",
